Description: DOT OS global theme for KDE Plasma
 The DOT OS desktop: a top bar and floating dock, flat panels and popups,
 window decorations, the dot grid wallpaper, lock screen, session splash and
 power screen. Installs system defaults so new users start in DOT OS.
